#: search2:search2_B52EAB6A_CF13_4FC3_8BDF_A4DD04E6FFD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8eb78fcab97dac4973d6b6a68f3ffa7a9ae909fcda291113abb0cdbf1e1c8964
#. default-sha256: da653ee1a8f2e449da21a23f59452a27b2b9e0d9d7bf16545557ed84028924fe
msgctxt "search2:search2_B52EAB6A_CF13_4FC3_8BDF_A4DD04E6FFD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion has taken on a very different face from when Giselle was leading me through its "
"halls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ジゼルが私の手を引き、⟪k:1⟫導き続けていた時と――館の様相が変わっている。⟪k:2⟫誰のものとも知れ"
"ぬ血液は、⟪k:3⟫足元のみならず――"

#: search2:search2_C56DA4F8_1A75_46EB_ADAA_B7EA8720943F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddd296a0423733e240e1b477c9c195e7200a36d481cfe4ede494c5352d8cec69
#. default-sha256: 2ddccc9bd314734cbb11265fc67effa9e5ac03dcddd5cf7d2180987ce8abfddc
msgctxt "search2:search2_C56DA4F8_1A75_46EB_ADAA_B7EA8720943F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Blood of unknown origin not only covers the floor,⟪k:2⟫but also streams down the walls "
"and drips from the ceiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫壁を濡らし、⟪k:2⟫天井から、⟪k:3⟫滴り落ちていた。"

#: search2:search2_C0DC5FF1_0C16_4E74_9924_A253D589E779
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d3fc4434a6f8c369900c80e3946b6318390e9a65099a75c1645389f7709ca4c
#. default-sha256: 304bbf0b52752ba4c1c040fe14d8b588967bf918f31be6c796141392b507e72a
msgctxt "search2:search2_C0DC5FF1_0C16_4E74_9924_A253D589E779"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m speechless as I behold the dreadful scene.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Every breath I take tastes and "
"smells of rust."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫視界一面に広がる異様な光景に、⟪k:1⟫私は言葉を失っていた。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫息を吸いこめば、⟪k:4⟫それ"
"だけ、⟪k:5⟫錆びついた血臭がする。"

#: search2:search2_EC7E50AC_94F3_4F4E_9CB3_398A34C3BBAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26ef39efb0abac083780cf15e76e6798e272dd7cb050bee75fef76f9fa852feb
