msgctxt "search2:search2_EC7E50AC_94F3_4F4E_9CB3_398A34C3BBAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It’s all so... ⟪k:1⟫unreal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あまりに――、⟪k:1⟫現実的で、⟪k:2⟫ない。"

#: search2:search2_44E62CF9_E6C3_4C50_AEAB_30D5C2F230FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3728de61abe89031c35ccd3f50bbc9e6c835b243a4dc77e1b8f7abb35c237189
#. default-sha256: 92108e40bea9e8c92728e74bc6b0c11700eaa8700690b3025491d42161f41546
msgctxt "search2:search2_44E62CF9_E6C3_4C50_AEAB_30D5C2F230FB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I can do is stare, aghast—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫feeling like I might pass out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ただただ、⟪k:1⟫その悪夢のような光景に呆然とし、⟪k:2⟫眩暈を感じる。"

#: search2:search2_FDB3E01C_9C46_41F8_BD42_8A98C8B25356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8a1a6615763b3a2ee885a9067d146cecf24687e2462e2bd89707ddbe2066875
