msgctxt "search2:search2_FDB3E01C_9C46_41F8_BD42_8A98C8B25356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I promise... ⟪k:1⟫I will come for you...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So please, just hang in there for a little "
"longer..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫必ず……、⟪k:1⟫迎えに行く……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫だから、⟪k:4⟫どうか――もう少しだけ……、⟪k:5⟫待っていて欲し"
"い……。"

